#: index.php:349
msgid ""
"Selecting a real USB drive launches the formatting engine through pkexec, so "
"you will be prompted for an administrator password. Mounted partitions are "
"unmounted automatically, or you are warned before they are wiped."
msgstr ""

#: index.php:350
msgid ""
"Creating an image file instead of formatting a device requires no privileges "
"at all."
msgstr ""

#: index.php:351
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Anmärkningar om ISO-stödet:"

#: index.php:352
#, fuzzy, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus for Linux allows the creation of a bootable USB drive or disk image "
"from an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Alla versioner av Rufus sen version 1.1.0 tillåter dig att skapa en startbar "
"USB från en <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO-avbild</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:353
#, fuzzy, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a disc burning application such as "
"the freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>xorriso</a>, or with <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>dd</a>."
msgstr ""
"Att skapa en ISO-avbild av en fysisk disk eller från en bunt filer är "
"väldigt enkelt att göra med hjälp utav gratisprogrammen  <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> eller <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>CDBurnerXP</a>."

